      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SKEDADDLE BENNY (8) had some strong recent form but was below best last time when fifth (20.85) in a Grade 5 at Nowra. Drifted back and never in it from the wide draw. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Can bounce back. GENERAL LEE (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Gunnedah behind Armatree Asafa (30.75) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Must be included in calculations. TELL ME ENOUGH (2) comes off an average run last start when eighth at this track over 400m behind Pay Ruby (24.16) in a Grade 5. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings five times from seven starts. In the mix. TOMMY'S AVA (5) missed the frame latest (18.46) when fourth over 320m at this track in a NG. Has two wins already from this draw.",
